# Build from spec

Follow `documents/LOAN-LENS-SPEC.md`, `documents/LOAN-LENS-DEV-CHECKLIST.md`, and `AGENTS.md`.

- Implement **one** checklist session at a time. Read that session first.
- Read only the SPEC sections the session lists.
- Do not implement later sessions or out-of-V1 / roadmap work.
- Never invent missing loan amounts, dates, or identities; keep vision providers behind `VisionProvider`.
- Run the session Verify commands before calling the work done.
- Update checklist progress only after verification succeeds.
